#: ../../source/docs/common-thecube-overview.rst:5
#: 5c25208545a0413f9d08ddc124be607f
msgid "The Cube Black"
msgstr "The Cube Black"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecube-overview.rst:12
#: f0a5b2c30e2547a6a65a770c9cea5dda
msgid "System Features"
msgstr "系统特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecube-overview.rst:14
#: 3f8254ed7e34424899fdaead7d01008f
msgid ""
"The Cube Black autopilot is a further evolution of the Pixhawk autopilot. It"
" is designed for commercial systems and manufacturers who wish to fully "
"integrate an autopilot into their system. On top of the existing features of"
" Pixhawk, it has the following enhancements:"
msgstr ""
"The Cube Black 飞控是 Pixhawk 飞控的进一步演化版本。专为希望将飞控完全集成到其系统中的商业系统及制造商而设计。在 Pixhawk"
" 现有功能的基础上，它具有以下增强特性："

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecube-overview.rst:16
#: 6ed5bf6cfe624050a69ce6e264dc604f
msgid "3 sets of IMU sensors for extra redundancy"
msgstr "3 组 IMU 传感器，提供额外冗余"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecube-overview.rst:17
#: 3fa38cb8fed54acebe5a08f78251ad5a
msgid ""
"2 sets of IMU are vibration-isolated mechanically, reducing the effect of "
"frame vibration to state estimation"
msgstr "2 组 IMU 通过机械减震隔离，降低机架震动对状态估计的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecube-overview.rst:18
#: 0471f69c44b74203b5c1f4e1c30245a8
msgid ""
"IMUs are temperature-controlled by onboard heating resistors, allowing "
"optimum working temperature of IMUs"
msgstr "IMU 通过板载加热电阻进行温控，使 IMU 保持最佳工作温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecube-overview.rst:19
#: 3c1f1045053241668a78b96e4de52e22
msgid ""
"The entire flight management unit(FMU) and inertial management unit(IMU) are"
" housed in a relatively small form factor (a cube). All inputs and outputs "
"go through a 80-pin DF17 connector, allowing a plug-in solution for "
"manufacturers of commercial systems. Manufacturers can design their own "
"carrier boards to suite their specific needs."
msgstr ""
"整个飞行管理单元（FMU）和惯性管理单元（IMU）集成在相对小巧的外形（方块）中。所有输入输出均通过 80 针 DF17 "
"连接器连接，为商业系统制造商提供即插即用方案。制造商可根据特定需求设计自己的载板。"

